      "content": "It sounds like the weight of your daily reality is becoming unbearable, and that desire for the noise to stop is a desperate cry for relief. When the struggle feels this immense, the idea of peace can sound like the only option. Please know that there are people who want to help you find a different kind of peace that doesn't involve ending things. Reaching out to a crisis line can offer immediate, confidential support to navigate these overwhelming feelings.",
      "source": "target",
