      "content": "It is profoundly painful to witness suffering, both in someone you love and within yourself. When everything feels messy and painful, the idea of stillness can seem like the only kindness. Please understand that this feeling of needing to end the pain is a symptom of despair, not a directive. There are ways to find relief from this immense burden that don't involve permanent endings; please let someone help you find those alternatives.",
